(Aakam360 offers several key features, known as the 5i:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. **Industry**: Understanding industry needs for hiring and providing dedicated/open infrastructure with high) Tj
T* (amenities.) Tj
T* (2. **Institution**: Access to a talent pool of over 2000 students, 30+ live industry labs, and 100+ research) Tj
T* (scholars for R&D.) Tj
T* (3. **Incubation**: Encouraging new ideas and providing space for young entrepreneurs, along with hiring) Tj
T* (talent to meet demand.) Tj
T* (4. **Innovation**: Offering innovative solutions to industrial problems and disrupting industries with) Tj
T* (game-changing innovations.) Tj
T* (5. **Internship**: Providing students with real-world experience and periodic curriculum enhancements) Tj
T* (through internships.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (If you have any more questions or need further details, feel free to ask!) Tj
